    "7c9a9bc3-0a01-41cd-8c45-6f1470bbea85": {
      "type": "design_pack_-_faq_-_simple",
      "blocks": {
        "template--16177583915195__7c9a9bc3-0a01-41cd-8c45-6f1470bbea85-1685490004f07dcd56-0": {
          "type": "section_heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Customers ask..."
          }
        },
        "template--16177583915195__7c9a9bc3-0a01-41cd-8c45-6f1470bbea85-1685490004f07dcd56-1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do you use real gold?",
            "text": "<p>Absolutely. We only use real gold plating on all of our gold pieces. Underneath, we use pure stainless steel so that you can wear this piece around water and sweat and never worry about any fading or tarnishing. Men's pieces are also made with pure steel for the same waterproof &amp; sweatproof promise.</p>"
          }
        },
        "template--16177583915195__7c9a9bc3-0a01-41cd-8c45-6f1470bbea85-1685490004f07dcd56-2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is your return policy?",
            "text": "<p>It's simple; if you don't like your piece for any reason, you have 100 days to send it back for a full refund. Period. In the US, we'll even pay for your return label. Start your self-serve return right <a href=\"https://nominal.loopreturns.com/#/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://nominal.loopreturns.com/#/\" aria-label=\"link\">here</a> and we'll take care of the rest.</p>"
          }
        },
        "template--16177583915195__7c9a9bc3-0a01-41cd-8c45-6f1470bbea85-1685490004f07dcd56-5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What should I know before gifting?",
            "text": "<p>We know how important the gifting experience is, so we've made it easy:</p><p>Prices are never shown in the package, and a receipt is never needed for them to begin an exchange. Every piece is packed in a gorgeous gift-ready velvet pouch, and an upgrade to a box for each item is always available. Happy gifting!</p>"
          }
        },
        "template--16177583915195__7c9a9bc3-0a01-41cd-8c45-6f1470bbea85-1685490004f07dcd56-3": {
          "type": "section_heading",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "Shipping"
          }
        },
        "template--16177583915195__7c9a9bc3-0a01-41cd-8c45-6f1470bbea85-1685490004f07dcd56-4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is there a warranty with my piece?",
            "text": "<p>Absolutely. We cover every single piece we sell with a Lifetime Warranty against any rust or tarnish, with the exception of watches &amp; our fine jewelry collection which contain a different warranty. Read above in the Materials &amp; Warranty section to find exact details. <br></p><p>For standard jewelry, if you ever experience any fading on your jewelry, just e-mail us a photo and we'll get you taken care of.</p>"
          }
        },
        "template--16177583915195__7c9a9bc3-0a01-41cd-8c45-6f1470bbea85-1685490004f07dcd56-6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I wear this in the shower?",
            "text": "<p>Yes! That's exactly why we made Nominal - we felt that beautiful jewelry deserves to be worn daily. Because we use only real gold plating and pure hypoallergenic stainless steel, you can wear your piece day in and day out, including in the shower, with no worries about skin sensitivity, jewelry fading, or anything in between. Wear and enjoy. <em><strong>*Please note, though, that Qur'anic pieces should be tucked away or removed prior to entering the restroom.*</strong></em></p>"
          }
        }
      },
