            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Copy_of_Essential_Bangle_1.jpg",
            "title": "No Compromises",
            "info": "<p>With NOMINAL, nothing but gold or silver touches your neck—it’s that simple. Unlike other retailers/e-commerce sites that offer cheaper solutions plated in gold, our gold-bonded Cuban Link Chains are pure 925 sterling silver coated 3x in the same 14k gold as our solid 14k gold jewelry.</p>",
